WEBVTT

00:00:28.107 --> 00:00:30.193
And then one of the doctors says this:

00:00:30.651 --> 00:00:34.363
"As we speak, flesh-eating bacteria
is crawling up your leg.

00:00:34.989 --> 00:00:38.534
It's getting closer to your vital
organs every minute."

00:00:38.576 --> 00:00:40.369
Good morning to you, too, doctor.

00:00:40.411 --> 00:00:41.746
(Laughter)

00:00:41.788 --> 00:00:43.331
Let me back up.

00:00:43.331 --> 00:00:45.416
I'm a professional football player.

00:00:45.458 --> 00:00:47.251
I played quarterback.

00:00:47.293 --> 00:00:50.088
And two weeks earlier, two defenders,

00:00:50.088 --> 00:00:52.507
almost 500 pounds of muscle,

00:00:52.507 --> 00:00:54.383
crushed me at the same time.

00:00:55.009 --> 00:00:58.930
It sounds scary, but honestly,
it's pretty normal in my line of work.